// Four packed bytes accompany each source frame. Nibbles are PICO-8 palette
// indices in the renderer's bottom-row-to-top-row memory order. The runtime
// expands the selected frame through pico8_tia_palette into the two RAM color
// tables, so colored body bands move with the original animation instead of
// being guessed from transparent top-row offsets.
